{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/parafrase/layout,_N_T_/tools/parafrase/page,_N_T_/tools/parafrase"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"id\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/c70a6d8e0709b465.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/7eb325243a3b1d61.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-2718004965b0207a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2117-c5687b942395652d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f30bb01764683cd9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-8ce94bd856f9372b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4194-e847e413fe1b63d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/parafrase/page-31a2aae7d64b0e02.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-c819fc26cf8b0e32.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-8K10RNGN76\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\"/><title>Tool Parafrase Teks AI Gratis | TugasMu</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tulis ulang teks tugasmu dengan bahasa yang unik dan anti-plagiat menggunakan AI TugasMu.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tugasmu.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TugasMu\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy bg-brand-lime\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Parafrase</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"w-full bg-surface min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"Cara Memparafrase Teks dengan AI TugasMu\",\"description\":\"Langkah mudah menggunakan alat parafrase gratis dari TugasMu\",\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Pilih Konteks\",\"text\":\"Pilih jenjang, kelas, kurikulum, dan mata pelajaran.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Masukkan Teks\",\"text\":\"Tempel teks yang ingin diparafrase ke dalam kotak.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Generate & Salin\",\"text\":\"Klik tombol 'Parafrase Sekarang' dan salin hasilnya.\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Apa itu Parafrase?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Parafrase adalah menulis ulang sebuah teks menggunakan kata-kata sendiri tanpa mengubah makna dasar dari teks aslinya.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Mengapa menggunakan TugasMu?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"TugasMu dirancang khusus untuk memahami konteks siswa Indonesia sehingga hasil parafrase terdengar lebih natural dan disesuaikan dengan tingkat sekolah.\"}}]}</script><section class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto w-full px-margin md:px-margin-desktop py-space-lg\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-body-sm mb-space-md\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">home</span><span>Beranda</span></a><span class=\"text-outline-variant font-medium\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools AI</a><span class=\"text-outline-variant font-medium\">/</span><span class=\"text-on-surface font-semibold\">Parafrase Teks &amp; Makalah</span></nav><div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-space-lg md:p-space-xl shadow-sm mb-space-lg relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute -right-12 -top-12 w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-primary-container/10 blur-2xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-lg relative z-10\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-xs\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; 1\">thumb_up</span>Rekomendasi</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm\">Lolos Turnitin</span></div><h1 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight\">Parafrase Teks &amp; Makalah</h1><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl\">Ubah susunan kalimat tugas agar terdengar natural, santun, dan bebas plagiasi tanpa mengubah inti materi akademik.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center flex-wrap gap-space-xs shrink-0 self-start lg:self-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-space-md py-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md transition-all shadow-sm\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">menu_book</span><span>Panduan Tool</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg items-start\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-space-lg md:p-space-xl shadow-sm space-y-space-lg sticky top-20 border border-slate-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-space-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-primary-container text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">tune</span></div><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface\">Konfigurasi AI</h2></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed\">AI Mode Pintar</span></div><form class=\"space-y-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-md mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><label for=\"inputText\" class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Teks Sumber</label><span class=\"text-outline font-body-sm text-body-sm\">Min. 10 karakter</span></div><textarea id=\"inputText\" rows=\"6\" class=\"w-full p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all placeholder:text-outline resize-y\" placeholder=\"Salin teks tugas atau makalah dari buku/website ke sini...\" required=\"\"></textarea><div class=\"flex justify-end text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm\">0<!-- --> / 2000 karakter</div></div><div class=\"pt-space-xs space-y-space-xs\"><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\" class=\"w-full py-3.5 px-space-lg rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-headline-sm text-headline-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all active:scale-[0.98] disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]\">auto_awesome</span><span>Parafrase Sekarang (Gratis)</span></button><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-on-secondary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm text-center\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-secondary\">bolt</span><span>100% Bebas Kuota Harian • Standar Guru</span></div></div></form></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-space-md\"></div></div><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Panduan &amp; FAQ: Tool Parafrase TugasMu</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan seputar penulisan ulang teks akademik untuk jenjang SD, SMP, SMA, dan sederajat.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apa itu tool parafrase online gratis dari TugasMu?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Tool parafrase TugasMu adalah kecerdasan buatan (AI) yang dirancang khusus untuk pelajar Indonesia dalam menyusun ulang struktur kalimat dari sebuah teks atau makalah tanpa mengubah makna aslinya. Alat ini sangat cocok bagi siswa SD, SMP, dan SMA dalam mengerjakan tugas Kurikulum Merdeka agar terhindar dari plagiasi.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Bagaimana cara memparafrase teks tugas agar lolos Turnitin dan tidak plagiat?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Untuk memastikan hasil parafrasemu aman dari deteksi plagiarisme seperti Turnitin, cukup salin teks dari sumber referensi (buku cetak, jurnal, atau website) lalu tempelkan ke dalam kotak input. AI TugasMu akan secara otomatis mengganti sinonim, mengubah struktur kalimat aktif-pasif, dan menyesuaikan gaya bahasa sehingga teks tersebut terbaca original dan otentik 100%.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah hasil parafrase TugasMu aman untuk membuat makalah Kurikulum Merdeka?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Sangat aman! Berbeda dengan tool terjemahan atau parafrase robotik pada umumnya, TugasMu sudah dilatih untuk memahami pedoman Ejaan Yang Disempurnakan (EYD) dan konteks pendidikan Indonesia. Khusus untuk <strong>Kurikulum Merdeka</strong>, hasil teks yang dikeluarkan didesain untuk mendorong bernalar kritis dan bahasa yang santun, sehingga sangat layak diserahkan kepada guru.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Berapa batasan kata atau kalimat yang bisa diparafrase sekaligus?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Saat ini kamu dapat memparafrase paragraf, rangkuman, maupun bagian-bagian penting dari makalah dalam satu kali proses (umumnya hingga 500-1000 kata tergantung ketersediaan limit AI). Jika kamu memiliki dokumen yang sangat panjang, kami menyarankan untuk membaginya menjadi beberapa paragraf agar hasil tulisan ulang lebih akurat dan terstruktur rapi.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apa bedanya mode santai, formal, dan akademik pada parafrase otomatis ini?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>TugasMu memahami bahwa setiap tugas memiliki gaya bahasanya sendiri. Mode <strong>Formal/Akademik</strong> sangat direkomendasikan untuk pembuatan Karya Ilmiah Remaja (KIR), Laporan Praktikum, dan Makalah. Sedangkan mode <strong>Santai</strong> lebih cocok digunakan untuk menyusun skrip presentasi lisan, esai opini, atau artikel blog sekolah agar lebih mudah dipahami oleh teman sebaya.</p></div></div></details></div></section></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.com</span></div><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 TugasMu.com. Hak cipta dilindungi.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Beranda</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/privasi\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/syarat\">Terms of Service</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/kontak\">Kontak</a></div></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=sel